<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40475" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">raucĭtas</span></b> , ātis,
			f.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>Hoarseness</i>, <i>raucity</i> (not
			ante-Aug.), <i><span class="en">Cels. 2, 1 <i>med.</i></span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Scrib. Comp. 184</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 20, 6,
				23, § 53</span></i>; and in plur., <i><span class="en">id. 22, 23,
				49, § 104</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b>
			<i>A snoring</i>, <i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 8,
				§ 804</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b> Of the <i>hoarse sound</i> of the
			tuba, <i><span class="en">Plin. 11, 51, 112, §
		269</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
